From 166979e2ce99fc1f22842a51508700d264936e95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:06:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Drive annotation holder from native source events

Replace fixed input polling with Linux filesystem invalidation and one-shot projection deadlines, keeping lease beats source-read-free. Preserve bounded fallback for undeclared plugins, request age-expiry reads, watch-loss recovery, mutation/demand propagation, and short-lived local board reads. Close local observation and replica projection handles before final derivation.

Proof: canonical annotation and consumer suites pass including 61s real projection idle/demand churn below 500 voluntary cs/s, change under 1s, source removal, read recovery, deadline transitions, watch loss and injected overflow. scripts/check passes all 21 checks.

Known residuals per approved bounded scope: request/adoption age expiry keeps existing fingerprint/read behavior; chat-closeout remains undeclared with logged bounded fallback; whole-refresh single-open batching is not claimed. Isolated fixture uses controlled discovery/lease/providers, not live hub acceptance. No live serve signals; combined measurement belongs t_1c8084f47fd24c4f. Mods WIP excluded.
